@page "/About"

<PageTitle>About Us</PageTitle>

<div class="about-container">

    <h1>About Our Incident Management System</h1>

    <p class="intro">
        Our Incident Management System provides a simple and
        convenient way for users to report incidents and monitor
        their progress.
    </p>

    <hr />

    <h3>Our Purpose</h3>
    <p>
        The purpose of this system is to improve how incidents
        are reported, managed, and resolved. Users can submit
        incidents such as water leaks, electricity problems,
        and other service-related issues.
    </p>

    <h3>Key Features</h3>
    <ul>
        <li>User registration and secure login</li>
        <li>Submit incidents with descriptions and locations</li>
        <li>Receive a unique incident reference number</li>
        <li>Track the status of reported incidents</li>
        <li>Allow administrators to manage and update incidents</li>
        <li>Maintain incident history and status updates</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Our Goal</h3>
    <p>
        Our goal is to make incident reporting more efficient
        and transparent by providing a centralized platform
        where incidents can be recorded, monitored, and managed.
    </p>

    <div class="about-footer">
        <p>
            <strong>Incident Management System</strong>
        </p>
        <p>
            Report it. Track it. Resolve it.
        </p>
    </div>

</div>

<style>
    .about-container {
        max-width: 900px;
        margin: 40px auto;
        padding: 30px;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 12px;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        color: #333333;
        line-height: 1.7;
    }

    h1 {
        color: #174a7e;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    h3 {
        color: #174a7e;
        margin-top: 25px;
    }

    .intro {
        font-size: 18px;
    }

    li {
        margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .about-footer {
        margin-top: 30px;
        padding: 20px;
        text-align: center;
        background-color: #eef5fb;
        border-radius: 8px;
    }

    .about-footer p {
        margin: 5px 0;
    }

    hr {
        border: none;
        border-top: 1px solid #dddddd;
        margin: 25px 0;
    }
</style>

